name hyperbar
category Package
revision 48147
shortdesc Add interactive Barcode fields to PDF forms
relocated 1
longdesc The package extends the hyperref functionality for creating
longdesc interactive forms to allow adding Barcode form fields supported
longdesc by some modern PDF readers. Currently, only pdfTeX is
longdesc supported.
